#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:6
msgid "$year"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$year(date[,date order])**"
msgstr "用法：**$year(date[,date order])**"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:9
msgid "Category: information"
msgstr "类别：信息"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.7"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.7"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:14
msgid "Returns the \"year\" portion of the input ``date``."
msgstr "返回输入 ``date`` 的 \"year\" 部分。"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:16
msgid "The \"year\", \"month\" and \"day\" portions of the date must be entered as numbers, and can be separated by any non-numeric characters. The default order for the input date is \"ymd\" (year, month, day). This can be changed by specifying a ``date order``."
msgstr ""
"日期的 \"year\"、\"month\" 和 \"day\" 部分必须作为数字输入，并且可以由任何非"
"数字字符分隔。输入日期的默认顺序是 \"ymd\"（年、月、日）。这可以通过指定一个 "
"``date order`` 来更改。"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:18
msgid "Valid entries for ``date order`` are:"
msgstr "``date order`` 的有效条目是："

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:20
msgid "**ymd** - year, month, day (This is the default order.)"
msgstr "**ymd** - 年、月、日（这是默认顺序。）"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:21
msgid "**dmy** - day, month, year"
msgstr "**dmy** - 日、月、年"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:22
msgid "**mdy** - month, day, year"
msgstr "**mdy** - 月、日、年"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:24
msgid "If the ``date`` is invalid an empty string will be returned. If an invalid ``date order`` is specified, the default order \"ymd\" will be used."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``date`` 无效，将返回空字符串。如果指定了无效的 ``date order``，将使用默"
"认顺序 \"ymd\"。"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:27
msgid "**Examples:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_year.rst:29
msgid "The following statements will return the values indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将返回指示的值："
